  <item>
    <coll>Bks</coll>
    <ref>Bks73.1</ref>
    <rnb>482</rnb>
    <tib>shes rab kyi bla na med par phyin pa mngon rtogs rig pa'i rtse mo</tib>
    <skt/>
    <coloph>dang po bde bar gshegs pa'i bka' / bar du 'od zer dpag med kyi thugs dam / tha mar 'gro ba sgrol ba'i rten gnas / bod dang zhang zhung gnyis kyi 'tshams / yul bya [~bye] ma la g.yung drung chu bo 'dus pa'i 'gor / zhang zhung mkhas pa stong rgyung mthu chen dang / se ne dmu tsha sha ri dbu chen gyis nges par bsgyur te bla zhus gtan la phabs / dran pa nam mkha' rgyal po'i phyag tu phul / rgyal pos yer pa'i rdzong la gter du sbas / [274r2] shes rab kyis bla na med par phyin pa 'di / dus la ma bab yer pa'i rdzong la / dran pa nam mkha' la sogs gshen rab rnams kyis / lung bstan smon lam btab nas gter du sbas / smon lam mtha' btsan yin pa gshen rab bka' nyan [~gnyan] pas / gtsang gi ban dhe gsum gyis zhal phyes nas / mdo stod du brang gnyag ston gzi brjid la / g.yung drung 'phrul ngag gter rdol dngos grub babs / mkhas pas sprul pa lung bstan yin par nges / tha mar dad ldan mas pa dgyer ston la / las dang smon lam thugs rjes shugs kyis babs / rgyu dang shes rab bla yis mi 'byor dang / dad pa'i stobs kyi yum 'di dgrol byas nas / phyi rab gshen la mos tsam bstan la gzhag / yum sras rgyud gsum gsung rab 'di / yar [~yer] pa sjong [~rdzong] gi gter nas thon / gnyag dang gyer gyi phyag na bdog / bzhengs ni dpa' gor dben tshar bzhengs</coloph>
